cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Dynamic Planetary Orbital Diagrams with Microsoft Word VBA"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Travis
    family-names: Stenborg
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2693-9628"
url: "https://github.com/tstenborg/dynamic-orbital-diagrams"
abstract: >-
  "This repository holds digital resources associated with the article \
  'Dynamic Planetary Orbital Diagrams with Microsoft Word VBA'. That article \
  discusses an automatically-updating orbital diagram of the Solar System's \
  planets in a Word document. A rendering routine was built with Visual Basic \
  for Applications (VBA), the scripting language built into Microsoft's \
  Office suite. Every time the document is opened, current planetary \
  positions are recalculated, and the orbital diagram updated accordingly."
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - "vba-word"
  - visualisation
